WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:04.058
My garden has many visitors.

2
00:00:04.059 --> 00:00:07.353
I say hello to them.

3
00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:11.558
The snail takes his shell everywhere.

4
00:00:11.559 --> 00:00:16.370
"Hello, Mr. Snail."

5
00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:20.269
The caterpillar chews on a leaf.

6
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:26.046
"Hello, Mrs. Caterpillar."

7
00:00:26.047 --> 00:00:30.329
The ant takes some food to his family.

8
00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.913
"Hello, Mr. Ant."

9
00:00:34.914 --> 00:00:38.457
The spider hangs from her web.

10
00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:44.102
"Hello, Mrs. Spider."

11
00:00:44.103 --> 00:00:47.505
The ladybug crawls on the bush.

12
00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:52.342
"Hello, Mrs. Ladybug."

13
00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:55.967
The bees buzz around the flowers.

14
00:00:55.968 --> 00:01:01.217
"Hello, Mr. and Mrs. Bee."

15
00:01:01.218 --> 00:01:07.996
I like all the visitors in my garden.

